{"id":"6d66122ce1a2d356","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property.md","title":"ZFC LC Weakly Compact Cardinal Property","display":"df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Weakly Compact Cardinal Property","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property","aliases":["58-df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property"],"display":"df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Weakly Compact Cardinal Property","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property — ZFC LC Weakly Compact Cardinal Property"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\in V\">\\(\\kappa\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\\)</span> is the strong-inaccessibility predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\)</span> is the function predicate (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\approx\">\\(\\approx\\)</span> is equinumerosity (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"28c79fde9f892bfe\" href=\"?note=28c79fde9f892bfe\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md\">../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWeaklyCompactCardinalProperty}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcLcWeaklyCompactCardinalProperty}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcWeaklyCompactCardinalProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^2,2)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;(H\\approx\\kappa\\land\\forall e\\in[H]^2\\;(c(e)=i))\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcWeaklyCompactCardinalProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^2,2)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;(H\\approx\\kappa\\land\\forall e\\in[H]^2\\;(c(e)=i))\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>This is the partition property <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\\to(\\kappa)^2_2\">\\(\\kappa\\to(\\kappa)^2_2\\)</span> together with strong inaccessibility.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md","status":"resolved","id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md","status":"resolved","id":"06ee5d7ff126e916","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S$ is the strong-inaccessibility predicate (see [[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Function}$ is the function predicate (see [[../batch16/58-df-function.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md","status":"resolved","id":"28c79fde9f892bfe","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\approx$ is equinumerosity (see [[../batch01/58-df-equinumerous.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Function}","display":false},{"tex":"\\approx","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcLcWeaklyCompactCardinalProperty}_S:V\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}lc\\text{-}weakly\\text{-}compact\\text{-}cardinal\\text{-}property} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcLcWeaklyCompactCardinalProperty}_S(\\kappa)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\forall c\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathrm{Function}(c,[\\kappa]^2,2)\\to\\exists H\\subseteq\\kappa\\;\\exists i\\in2\\;(H\\approx\\kappa\\land\\forall e\\in[H]^2\\;(c(e)=i))\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"\\kappa\\to(\\kappa)^2_2","display":false}],"bytes":1408,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2461","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property.md|58-df-zfc-lc-weakly-compact-cardinal-property]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","28c79fde9f892bfe","06ee5d7ff126e916","36d7463d215be751"]}